{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sammic-portable-electric-liquidiser-2608-0199","content_id":"4847caf7-5209-4562-b34b-0632a7da29a9","description":"Product Recall for Sammic Portable Electric Liquidiser presenting a risk of electric shock. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"010c117b-c9f4-4103-ac7e-b299db1b3cd7","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-21T13:20:47+01:00","id":"010c117b-c9f4-4103-ac7e-b299db1b3cd7","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-21T13:20:47+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a88429f86d9b627c475c02f/2608-0199-product-recall-sammic-portable-electric-liquidiser.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Sammic Portable Electric Liquidiser</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of electric shock because it is possible for the user to access live parts under fault conditions.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled by the manufacturer.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment – Juicers (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Sammic</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Portable electric liquidiser for commercial use. For a full list of identifiers, please see Annex A.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_010c117b-c9f4-4103-ac7e-b299db1b3cd7\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a88429f86d9b627c475c02f/2608-0199-product-recall-sammic-portable-electric-liquidiser.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of electric shock because it is designed as a double‑insulated electrical appliance, meaning that a second protective insulation must prevent user exposure in case the basic insulation fails.</p>\n\n<p>The manufacturer has identified that, in certain identification numbers, an external aluminium part accessible to the user may come into contact with the aluminium motor support if the first insulation layer fails. If an internal insulation fault occurred between the motor winding and the motor support, the fault could be transmitted to the accessible aluminium part, potentially exposing the user to electric shock.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled by the manufacturer. For more information, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://sammic-com.web.app/en/recall-xm\">https://sammic-com.web.app/en/recall-xm</a> or contact <a href=\"mailto:recallexport@sammic.com\">recallexport@sammic.com</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"annex-a\">Annex A</h3>\n<p>Models and product ranges affected:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>XM-21: 3030625 / 3030748 / 3030750.</li>\n  <li>XM-22: 3030626 / 3030629 / 3030754 / 3030756.</li>\n  <li>MB-21: 3030634 / 3030639 / 3030760 / 3030762.</li>\n  <li>MB-22: 3030763</li>\n  <li>B-20: 3030636 / 3030766 / 3030768.</li>\n  <li>MM-20V: 3030637.</li>\n  <li>MM-20: 3030742 / 3030744.</li>\n  <li>XM-31: 3030671 / 3030672 / 3030784 / 3030786.</li>\n  <li>XM-32: 3030673 / 3030674 / 3030790 / 3030792.</li>\n  <li>XM-33: 3030675 / 3030787 / 3030791 / 3030793.</li>\n  <li>MB-31: 3030676 / 3030796 / 3030798 / 3030805.</li>\n  <li>B-30: 3030669 / 3030802 / 3030804.</li>\n  <li>MM-30V: 3030667 / 3030778 / 3030780.</li>\n  <li>MM-30: 3030666 / 3030772 / 3030774.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2608-0199</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Health and Safety Executive</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-21T12:21:52Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"annex-a","level":3,"text":"Annex A"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-21","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-21T13:21:52+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sammic-portable-electric-liquidiser-2608-0199","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sammic-portable-electric-liquidiser-2608-0199","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sammic-portable-electric-liquidiser-2608-0199","content_id":"4847caf7-5209-4562-b34b-0632a7da29a9","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-21T12:21:52Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Sammic Portable Electric Liquidiser (2608-0199)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sammic-portable-electric-liquidiser-2608-0199","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","c